# The vsix ships exactly the extension's files: the bundle, the manifest, the listing pages and the icons the manifest
# names. Everything else (src/, scripts/, test/, SPEC.md, node_modules) stays out. scripts/package.mjs refuses to
# package when what vsce would ship differs from shippedFiles(manifest), so a new icon or file must be added here too.
**
!dist/extension.js
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE.md
!media/icon.png
!media/atf.svg
